<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-inf=
ormation">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"366de9343e37">Troubleshooting Access in the Future: Once thi=
s initial setup is completed the Owner role for the Subscriptions will be r=
emoved, Owner on the Resource Group and Storage Account will remain. This S=
HOULD allow the creation of additional Enterprise Policies and Synapse Link=
s in these Subscriptions in the future. If an issue arises, the team should=
 re-add Owner at the Subscription level to troubleshoot the problem.</p>
